message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
title: "TTT-core: Tri-Tetra Theory (TTT) integrated hub"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Kawakami
    given-names: Naoyuki
    alias: "川上 真潔"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0009-2972-6511"
    affiliation: "Independent researcher, Shiojiri, Nagano, Japan"
repository-code: "https://github.com/kiki054-n/TTT-core"
license: CC-BY-NC-SA-4.0
abstract: >-
  Integrated hub of the Tri-Tetra Theory (TTT): a geometric and topological
  framework starting from a single axiom (Axiom Z). Includes the mathematics
  (TTT-mathematics), physics verification notes with Python check scripts
  (TTT-physics), and speculative applications to society and consciousness
  (TTT-society, TTT-consciousness).
keywords:
  - Tri-Tetra Theory
  - TTT
  - geometry
  - topology
  - tetrahedron
  - fine-structure constant
  - cosmological constant
